  <item>
    <title>Vol.06 29岁，不是不结婚，只是还没结婚</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6722273a33c798676f2c0d94</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6722273a33c798676f2c0d94</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 12:46:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家~好久不见🙈</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期跟大家分享的是:</span></p><span></span><p><span>两位未婚主播提到婚姻会聊些什么?</span></p><span></span><p><span>最离谱的是29岁单身的我们，居然教大家怎么找对象？！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区互动，谈谈自己的想法 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>@小白cheerup：行走的话筒</span></p><span></span><p><span>@gapper豆豆：快乐小狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 越长大越"自私"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 不忍心让爸妈再为自己的小家付出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> 一些想结婚的瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 每一次朋友的婚礼现场我都心动了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 聊到婚礼嘴角咧得ak都压不住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 豆豆：婚礼我自己当纪律委员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 小白：我的婚礼是我的脱口秀专场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 是还没结婚，不是不结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 绕一百个弯都可以回到催婚的话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a> &nbsp;我只能解我自己的心结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 长辈总要关心、指导一下我们的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> 相亲成功率不高太正常不过啦!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 要有态度并表达态度!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 一些我爱吃的婚后狗粮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 聊到下头行为激动到抢话说!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 或许这样可以更容易遇到对的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《别找我麻烦》蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Time to Relax》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljkoD8MsAzwG05x_Hvo3wGaLwaox.m4a" length="39864805" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOYjfwtBfI7Zg-yoXVWbfx8y_30.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.05 有不扫兴的朋友多幸运！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668e6a3973ae1ca98cf4ffa2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668e6a3973ae1ca98cf4ffa2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期跟大家分享的是:</span></p><span></span><p><span>遇到不扫兴的朋友多快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过，朋友偶尔扫兴也没关系，自己别扫自己的兴最重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>@小白cheerup：行走的话筒</span></p><span></span><p><span>@gapper豆豆：快乐小狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 情绪稳定，包容的夏夏&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 看到绝美日出，收获了大自然的免费浪漫&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 有朋友陪着一起看Coldplay的演出，纳入人生moment!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 我好怕变成那种“扫兴朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a> 小白的情绪比二百五更重要 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 牙牙温柔地接住了我的坏情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 你垮脸，我就乱骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 我都可以做到，你为什么不可以&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 她送我价值”不对等“的礼物&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 谁收红包会不开心啊!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> 收到来自领导用心又用钱的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 她是我在泰国最大的牵挂&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 被J人支配的P人，超爽！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 给朋友拍出好看的照片是开心的&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《别找我麻烦》蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Time to Relax》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期彩蛋】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtERrVylS0j1BuuXQVKOpA8TKnpB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lumpGSZrxAYX6PmXwruy-XcvnSn3.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk6hM1r4jVyjxhfTaArkHhGljheF.m4a" length="33495199" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOYjfwtBfI7Zg-yoXVWbfx8y_30.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.04 三分钟热度又怎样！人生在于体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668534e70bc5d7cc708ede96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668534e70bc5d7cc708ede96</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期跟大家分享的是:</span></p><span></span><p><span>三分钟热度也可以换来十分的体验！今天我们从“半途而废”的羞耻，聊到感恩自己曾经因为三分钟热度制造了那么多珍贵的回忆。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>@小白cheerup：行走的话筒</span></p><span></span><p><span>@gapper豆豆：快乐小狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 又又又又想好好学英语了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 好难开口说：“我想放弃了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 窒息！家里来客人父母要我弹吉他“助兴”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 长大真好，可以为自己的兴趣爱好买单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 父母时不时泼冷水“打压”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 真正热爱无所谓坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 我曾经也是机车少女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 宝贵体验之“摆摊拍照”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 没有朋友捧场就倒贴两块钱&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 来拍照的妹妹送我们冰糖葫芦&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="947">15:47</a>那一次经历让我找到了脱口秀的舞台&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 欢迎大家来参加读书会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 喜欢躺着玩手机也可以呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 从“北野武”看到了我们自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1469">24:29</a> 生活中的快乐就是一个个三分钟热度堆积而来的</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《别找我麻烦》蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Time to Relax》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll-FIgQRw712gJqR6uHS0jP7iA1B.m4a" length="24605415" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAmQkyIyt9QPApupx7T-ijm15Kt.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 失恋！搞笑女也逃不过心碎时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667c221dc13b46d76c1591c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667c221dc13b46d76c1591c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Jun 2024 14:13:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期跟大家分享的是:</span></p><span></span><p><span>失恋！搞笑女也逃不过心碎时刻。没把大家当外人，舔狗失恋复盘分享。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>走出失恋的方式有很多种，而我选择撕开小白的旧伤口找平衡……</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>@小白cheerup：行走的话筒</span></p><span></span><p><span>@gapper豆豆：被雨淋湿的小狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a>谨慎!“舔狗”发言开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a>这期简直“扒光”了站在大家面前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a>哦豁～没得“舔”了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a>每一个都是见一个爱一个里最爱的一个</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a>让过去的过去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a>理解“负心汉”，成为“负心汉”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a>没有爱，我会死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a>有朋友真好!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a>分手以后我还在花前男友的钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a>我莫名其妙被“小三”了？!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a>他穿了一双澡堂拖鞋来见我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a>退一步海阔天空，忍一时越想越气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a>哭着打了一晚上贵阳捉鸡麻将</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《别找我麻烦》蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Time to Relax》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj-weIn2tqZotOVWVEtcLufIPbjU.m4a" length="29923563" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAmQkyIyt9QPApupx7T-ijm15Kt.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.02 我们积极相亲，却默默“下头”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6672fa07b6a8412729f3e2cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6672fa07b6a8412729f3e2cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 15:32:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期跟大家分享的是:</span></p><span></span><p><span>相亲过程中默默“下头”的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>鼓起勇气跟大家分享了“压箱底”的相亲故事，“下头”的理由可能不一定被理解，但是还是希望大家有勇气能果断且及时地结束一段不合适的关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>@小白cheerup：行走的话筒</span></p><span></span><p><span>@gapper豆豆：快乐小狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 是执着还是没有边界感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> 追不掉就删掉，破防了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 扭捏也会下头!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 是有多少钱一天担心别人图你钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 遇到拉横幅+捧花下跪的男的 快逃!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> “转钱哥”炸裂的三观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 他让我心动了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 跟高手学习情绪价值拉满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 大结局了，还不放过我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1671">27:51</a> 被“钓”的同时也学到了很多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a> 跟哥哥们道歉了</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：《别找我麻烦》蔡健雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《Time to Relax》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg0T8xWXbTPeLgiyhE0ISpmNgprP.m4a" length="27553725" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAmQkyIyt9QPApupx7T-ijm15Kt.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.01 有人为爱奔赴，“胆小狗”偷偷祝福</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6669726db6a84127293ad6ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6669726db6a84127293ad6ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jun 2024 10:03:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期跟大家分享的是:</span></p><p><span>有人为爱奔赴，“胆小狗”偷偷祝福的故事。</span></p><p><span>聊得比较零碎，以这样的方式回顾自己的一些经历，感受到了快乐的滞后性。</span></p><p><span>希望大家也能在此收获一些喜悦，打起精神!</span></p><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><p><span>@小白cheerup：行走的话筒</span></p><p><span>@gapper 豆豆：快乐小狗</span></p><p></p><p><span>⌛️时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a>两个e人无处安放的分享欲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a>双向奔赴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 微博小作文之祝福版</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">3:35</a> 做沙发客的经历，只有一次</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">5:03</a> 你有想过当沙发主吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">8:10</a> 活菩萨，提供沙发还开车来机场接我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a>遇见“对的”朋友会带给你的信念感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 摩羯座不能说“我不懂”!</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> “Hello，你最近怎么样啊？”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">23:16</a> 我在黄浦江等你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 他沉默的瞬间，我也得到了答案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">28:55</a> 这是一段愿意再次提起的回忆</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><p><span>片头：《别找我麻烦》蔡健雅</span></p><p><span>片尾：《Time to Relax》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luejlFrYp32dyhhjzaLD_nL4wRxt.m4a" length="36570714" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAmQkyIyt9QPApupx7T-ijm15Kt.jpg"/>
